{
 "voice": "af_bella",
 "speed": 1.0,
 "fps": 30,
 "sample_rate": 24000,
 "gaps": {
  "sentence": 0.35,
  "scene": 0.8,
  "lead": 0.3,
  "tail": 0.3
 },
 "scenes": [
  {
   "id": "s01_hook",
   "start": 0.3,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Two arrows in, one number out: the dot product.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 0.3,
     "end": 3.925,
     "dur": 3.625,
     "start_frame": 9,
     "end_frame": 118
    },
    {
     "text": "First what it is, then why it's built this way.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 4.275,
     "end": 7.675,
     "dur": 3.4,
     "start_frame": 128,
     "end_frame": 230
    }
   ],
   "end": 8.475,
   "start_frame": 9,
   "end_frame": 254
  },
  {
   "id": "s02_arrows",
   "start": 8.475,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "A vector is an arrow, with a length and a direction.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 8.475,
     "end": 12.225,
     "dur": 3.75,
     "start_frame": 254,
     "end_frame": 367
    },
    {
     "text": "Vector a goes five right and one up; vector b goes one right and three up.",
     "audio_text": "Vector [A](/ˈA/) goes five right and one up; vector b goes one right and three up.",
     "start": 12.575,
     "end": 18.075,
     "dur": 5.5,
     "start_frame": 377,
     "end_frame": 542
    },
    {
     "text": "Five and one are the components of vector a and one and three are the components of vector b.",
     "audio_text": "Five and one are the components of vector [A](/ˈA/) and one and three are the components of vector b.",
     "start": 18.425,
     "end": 24.975,
     "dur": 6.55,
     "start_frame": 553,
     "end_frame": 749
    },
    {
     "text": "Pythagoras gives the lengths, written with straight bars: about five point one and three point one six.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 25.325,
     "end": 32.35,
     "dur": 7.025,
     "start_frame": 760,
     "end_frame": 970
    }
   ],
   "end": 33.15,
   "start_frame": 254,
   "end_frame": 994
  },
  {
   "id": "s03_definition",
   "start": 33.15,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Definition one: multiply matching components, then add.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 33.15,
     "end": 37.575,
     "dur": 4.425,
     "start_frame": 994,
     "end_frame": 1127
    },
    {
     "text": "In space that's three products; our flat arrows have two components, so two.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 37.925,
     "end": 43.4,
     "dur": 5.475,
     "start_frame": 1138,
     "end_frame": 1302
    },
    {
     "text": "The first components are five and one; the second, one and three.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 43.75,
     "end": 48.325,
     "dur": 4.575,
     "start_frame": 1312,
     "end_frame": 1450
    },
    {
     "text": "Five times one, plus one times three: eight, one number, not an arrow.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 48.675,
     "end": 53.975,
     "dur": 5.3,
     "start_frame": 1460,
     "end_frame": 1619
    }
   ],
   "end": 54.775,
   "start_frame": 994,
   "end_frame": 1643
  },
  {
   "id": "s04_cosine",
   "start": 54.775,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Definition two multiplies the two lengths and the cosine of theta, the angle between the arrows.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 54.775,
     "end": 61.8,
     "dur": 7.025,
     "start_frame": 1643,
     "end_frame": 1854
    },
    {
     "text": "Cosine depends only on the angle, from minus one to one.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 62.15,
     "end": 66.5,
     "dur": 4.35,
     "start_frame": 1864,
     "end_frame": 1995
    },
    {
     "text": "Here it's point four nine six, and the product is eight again.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 66.85,
     "end": 71.1,
     "dur": 4.25,
     "start_frame": 2005,
     "end_frame": 2133
    },
    {
     "text": "Call this equation one.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 71.45,
     "end": 73.55,
     "dur": 2.1,
     "start_frame": 2143,
     "end_frame": 2206
    }
   ],
   "end": 74.35,
   "start_frame": 1643,
   "end_frame": 2230
  },
  {
   "id": "s05_angle_cases",
   "start": 74.35,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Now keep one arrow, p, fixed in all three pictures; only q turns.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 74.35,
     "end": 79.6,
     "dur": 5.25,
     "start_frame": 2230,
     "end_frame": 2388
    },
    {
     "text": "Same direction, zero degrees: three times two, six, positive.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 79.95,
     "end": 85.05,
     "dur": 5.1,
     "start_frame": 2398,
     "end_frame": 2551
    },
    {
     "text": "At a right angle, ninety degrees: zero.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 85.4,
     "end": 88.825,
     "dur": 3.425,
     "start_frame": 2562,
     "end_frame": 2665
    },
    {
     "text": "At one hundred and eighty degrees, pointing in opposite directions: minus six, negative.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 89.175,
     "end": 95.425,
     "dur": 6.25,
     "start_frame": 2675,
     "end_frame": 2863
    },
    {
     "text": "So the dot product measures how much two arrows point the same way.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 95.775,
     "end": 100.075,
     "dur": 4.3,
     "start_frame": 2873,
     "end_frame": 3002
    }
   ],
   "end": 100.875,
   "start_frame": 2230,
   "end_frame": 3026
  },
  {
   "id": "s06_shadow",
   "start": 100.875,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Drop a line from the tip of arrow a onto b's line, at a right angle.",
     "audio_text": "Drop a line from the tip of arrow [A](/ˈA/) onto b's line, at a right angle.",
     "start": 100.875,
     "end": 105.9,
     "dur": 5.025,
     "start_frame": 3026,
     "end_frame": 3177
    },
    {
     "text": "The stretch it marks off is the shadow of arrow a on b.",
     "audio_text": "The stretch it marks off is the shadow of arrow [A](/ˈA/) on b.",
     "start": 106.25,
     "end": 110.325,
     "dur": 4.075,
     "start_frame": 3187,
     "end_frame": 3310
    },
    {
     "text": "Arrow a is the long side of a right triangle, so the shadow, next to theta, is its length times cos theta.",
     "audio_text": "Arrow [A](/ˈA/) is the long side of a right triangle, so the shadow, next to theta, is its length times cos theta.",
     "start": 110.675,
     "end": 118.525,
     "dur": 7.85,
     "start_frame": 3320,
     "end_frame": 3556
    },
    {
     "text": "Divide both sides of equation one by the length of b.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 118.875,
     "end": 122.75,
     "dur": 3.875,
     "start_frame": 3566,
     "end_frame": 3682
    },
    {
     "text": "It cancels on the right, leaving the shadow: a dot b over the length of b: eight over three point one six two, or two point five three.",
     "audio_text": "It cancels on the right, leaving the shadow: [A](/ˈA/) dot b over the length of b: eight over three point one six two, or two point five three.",
     "start": 123.1,
     "end": 132.225,
     "dur": 9.125,
     "start_frame": 3693,
     "end_frame": 3967
    }
   ],
   "end": 133.025,
   "start_frame": 3026,
   "end_frame": 3991
  },
  {
   "id": "s07_unit_vector",
   "start": 133.025,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "A second way to the same shadow: divide b by its own length.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 133.025,
     "end": 137.325,
     "dur": 4.3,
     "start_frame": 3991,
     "end_frame": 4120
    },
    {
     "text": "That's b hat, the unit vector along b: length one, same direction.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 137.675,
     "end": 142.925,
     "dur": 5.25,
     "start_frame": 4130,
     "end_frame": 4288
    },
    {
     "text": "Its components are one and three, each over three point one six two.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 143.275,
     "end": 147.975,
     "dur": 4.7,
     "start_frame": 4298,
     "end_frame": 4439
    },
    {
     "text": "Dividing b by a number divides the dot product by it too, so the shadow is a dot b hat.",
     "audio_text": "Dividing b by a number divides the dot product by it too, so the shadow is [A](/ˈA/) dot b hat.",
     "start": 148.325,
     "end": 155.325,
     "dur": 7.0,
     "start_frame": 4450,
     "end_frame": 4660
    },
    {
     "text": "Five times point three one six, plus one times point nine four nine: two point five three again.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 155.675,
     "end": 162.6,
     "dur": 6.925,
     "start_frame": 4670,
     "end_frame": 4878
    }
   ],
   "end": 163.4,
   "start_frame": 3991,
   "end_frame": 4902
  },
  {
   "id": "s08_question",
   "start": 163.4,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "So the dot product is the shadow times the length of b.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 163.4,
     "end": 167.375,
     "dur": 3.975,
     "start_frame": 4902,
     "end_frame": 5021
    },
    {
     "text": "Why multiply by that length?",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 167.725,
     "end": 170.1,
     "dur": 2.375,
     "start_frame": 5032,
     "end_frame": 5103
    },
    {
     "text": "Three reasons.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 170.45,
     "end": 172.2,
     "dur": 1.75,
     "start_frame": 5113,
     "end_frame": 5166
    }
   ],
   "end": 173.0,
   "start_frame": 4902,
   "end_frame": 5190
  },
  {
   "id": "s09_reason1_order",
   "start": 173.0,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Reason one: order.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 173.0,
     "end": 175.35,
     "dur": 2.35,
     "start_frame": 5190,
     "end_frame": 5260
    },
    {
     "text": "The shadow of arrow a on b is two point five three; of b on arrow a, one point five seven.",
     "audio_text": "The shadow of arrow [A](/ˈA/) on b is two point five three; of b on arrow [A](/ˈA/), one point five seven.",
     "start": 175.7,
     "end": 182.725,
     "dur": 7.025,
     "start_frame": 5271,
     "end_frame": 5482
    },
    {
     "text": "But times the other arrow's length, both give eight.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 183.075,
     "end": 186.525,
     "dur": 3.45,
     "start_frame": 5492,
     "end_frame": 5596
    }
   ],
   "end": 187.325,
   "start_frame": 5190,
   "end_frame": 5620
  },
  {
   "id": "s10_reason2_cheap",
   "start": 187.325,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Reason two: it's cheap, with no angle and no square root.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 187.325,
     "end": 191.65,
     "dur": 4.325,
     "start_frame": 5620,
     "end_frame": 5749
    },
    {
     "text": "Take the wind v equals six, eight: six metres per second east, eight north.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 192.0,
     "end": 197.575,
     "dur": 5.575,
     "start_frame": 5760,
     "end_frame": 5927
    },
    {
     "text": "The unit vector x hat points east: components one and zero.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 197.925,
     "end": 202.45,
     "dur": 4.525,
     "start_frame": 5938,
     "end_frame": 6073
    },
    {
     "text": "So v dot x hat is six times one plus eight times zero: six, the eastward part.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 202.8,
     "end": 209.325,
     "dur": 6.525,
     "start_frame": 6084,
     "end_frame": 6280
    }
   ],
   "end": 210.125,
   "start_frame": 5620,
   "end_frame": 6304
  },
  {
   "id": "s11_work",
   "start": 210.125,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Reason three: physics needs both sizes.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 210.125,
     "end": 213.6,
     "dur": 3.475,
     "start_frame": 6304,
     "end_frame": 6408
    },
    {
     "text": "Pull a sled with twenty newtons, tilted sixty degrees up.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 213.95,
     "end": 218.225,
     "dur": 4.275,
     "start_frame": 6418,
     "end_frame": 6547
    },
    {
     "text": "The upward part, across the motion, does no work.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 218.575,
     "end": 222.225,
     "dur": 3.65,
     "start_frame": 6557,
     "end_frame": 6667
    },
    {
     "text": "The part along the ground is the shadow: twenty times cos sixty, ten newtons.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 222.575,
     "end": 228.325,
     "dur": 5.75,
     "start_frame": 6677,
     "end_frame": 6850
    },
    {
     "text": "That shadow is itself a force, and only it does work.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 228.675,
     "end": 232.625,
     "dur": 3.95,
     "start_frame": 6860,
     "end_frame": 6979
    },
    {
     "text": "Work, in joules, is that force times the distance: fifty joules over five metres, one hundred over ten.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 232.975,
     "end": 240.475,
     "dur": 7.5,
     "start_frame": 6989,
     "end_frame": 7214
    },
    {
     "text": "Twice the distance, twice the work.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 240.825,
     "end": 243.575,
     "dur": 2.75,
     "start_frame": 7225,
     "end_frame": 7307
    }
   ],
   "end": 244.375,
   "start_frame": 6304,
   "end_frame": 7331
  },
  {
   "id": "s12_parcel",
   "start": 244.375,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Now the weather.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 244.375,
     "end": 246.025,
     "dur": 1.65,
     "start_frame": 7331,
     "end_frame": 7381
    },
    {
     "text": "One thermometer is fixed on a pole: its rate is partial T by partial t, the local rate.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 246.375,
     "end": 253.15,
     "dur": 6.775,
     "start_frame": 7391,
     "end_frame": 7594
    },
    {
     "text": "Partial means only time changes; the place stays fixed.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 253.5,
     "end": 257.775,
     "dur": 4.275,
     "start_frame": 7605,
     "end_frame": 7733
    },
    {
     "text": "A second one rides a balloon drifting with the wind.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 258.125,
     "end": 262.1,
     "dur": 3.975,
     "start_frame": 7744,
     "end_frame": 7863
    },
    {
     "text": "It always measures the same air parcel: a small volume of air that moves with the flow.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 262.45,
     "end": 268.5,
     "dur": 6.05,
     "start_frame": 7873,
     "end_frame": 8055
    },
    {
     "text": "Its rate, capital D T by D t, is the material derivative: the rate following an air parcel.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 268.85,
     "end": 276.125,
     "dur": 7.275,
     "start_frame": 8065,
     "end_frame": 8284
    }
   ],
   "end": 276.925,
   "start_frame": 7331,
   "end_frame": 8308
  },
  {
   "id": "s13_equation",
   "start": 276.925,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "The equation: capital D phi by D t equals partial phi by partial t, plus v dot grad phi.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 276.925,
     "end": 284.675,
     "dur": 7.75,
     "start_frame": 8308,
     "end_frame": 8540
    },
    {
     "text": "Phi is anything the air carries, like temperature or moisture; v is the wind.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 285.025,
     "end": 290.325,
     "dur": 5.3,
     "start_frame": 8551,
     "end_frame": 8710
    },
    {
     "text": "The last term is the change from being carried across the map: the advection of phi.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 290.675,
     "end": 296.35,
     "dur": 5.675,
     "start_frame": 8720,
     "end_frame": 8890
    },
    {
     "text": "For temperature, phi is T, and v dot grad T is the advection of temperature.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 296.7,
     "end": 302.625,
     "dur": 5.925,
     "start_frame": 8901,
     "end_frame": 9079
    }
   ],
   "end": 303.425,
   "start_frame": 8308,
   "end_frame": 9103
  },
  {
   "id": "s14_isotherms",
   "start": 303.425,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "The thin lines are isotherms: lines of equal temperature.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 303.425,
     "end": 307.975,
     "dur": 4.55,
     "start_frame": 9103,
     "end_frame": 9239
    },
    {
     "text": "Here they run north to south, one every hundred kilometres.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 308.325,
     "end": 312.6,
     "dur": 4.275,
     "start_frame": 9250,
     "end_frame": 9378
    },
    {
     "text": "Walk east, and each one you cross is one degree warmer.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 312.95,
     "end": 316.95,
     "dur": 4.0,
     "start_frame": 9389,
     "end_frame": 9509
    },
    {
     "text": "That's partial T by partial x: the change going east only.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 317.3,
     "end": 322.2,
     "dur": 4.9,
     "start_frame": 9519,
     "end_frame": 9666
    },
    {
     "text": "Walk north, and you stay on one isotherm: partial T by partial y is zero.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 322.55,
     "end": 328.375,
     "dur": 5.825,
     "start_frame": 9677,
     "end_frame": 9851
    }
   ],
   "end": 329.175,
   "start_frame": 9103,
   "end_frame": 9875
  },
  {
   "id": "s15_grad_t",
   "start": 329.175,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "These two slopes are the components of one arrow: grad T.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 329.175,
     "end": 333.4,
     "dur": 4.225,
     "start_frame": 9875,
     "end_frame": 10002
    },
    {
     "text": "The upside-down triangle is read grad.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 333.75,
     "end": 337.025,
     "dur": 3.275,
     "start_frame": 10013,
     "end_frame": 10111
    },
    {
     "text": "Here it's ten to the minus five kelvin per metre, and zero.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 337.375,
     "end": 341.55,
     "dur": 4.175,
     "start_frame": 10121,
     "end_frame": 10247
    },
    {
     "text": "Grad T points uphill, towards warmer air; its length is how steep the map is.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 341.9,
     "end": 347.65,
     "dur": 5.75,
     "start_frame": 10257,
     "end_frame": 10430
    }
   ],
   "end": 348.45,
   "start_frame": 9875,
   "end_frame": 10454
  },
  {
   "id": "s16_advection_number",
   "start": 348.45,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Now a wind of ten metres per second blows sixty degrees from grad T.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 348.45,
     "end": 353.95,
     "dur": 5.5,
     "start_frame": 10454,
     "end_frame": 10619
    },
    {
     "text": "Its shadow on grad T, ten times cos sixty, is five metres per second: the speed straight towards warmer air.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 354.3,
     "end": 362.65,
     "dur": 8.35,
     "start_frame": 10629,
     "end_frame": 10880
    },
    {
     "text": "The rest of the wind runs along the isotherms.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 363.0,
     "end": 366.75,
     "dur": 3.75,
     "start_frame": 10890,
     "end_frame": 11003
    },
    {
     "text": "Times the length of grad T, the metres cancel: five times ten to the minus five kelvin per second, or point one eight kelvin per hour.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 367.1,
     "end": 376.475,
     "dur": 9.375,
     "start_frame": 11013,
     "end_frame": 11294
    }
   ],
   "end": 377.275,
   "start_frame": 10454,
   "end_frame": 11318
  },
  {
   "id": "s17_space_time",
   "start": 377.275,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Careful: one degree per hundred kilometres is the map's slope, a rate in space.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 377.275,
     "end": 383.15,
     "dur": 5.875,
     "start_frame": 11318,
     "end_frame": 11495
    },
    {
     "text": "Point one eight kelvin per hour is a rate in time.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 383.5,
     "end": 387.125,
     "dur": 3.625,
     "start_frame": 11505,
     "end_frame": 11614
    },
    {
     "text": "Each hour, the air gains eighteen kilometres towards warmth, reaching spots that were point one eight degrees warmer when it set off.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 387.475,
     "end": 395.875,
     "dur": 8.4,
     "start_frame": 11624,
     "end_frame": 11876
    }
   ],
   "end": 396.675,
   "start_frame": 11318,
   "end_frame": 11900
  },
  {
   "id": "s18_label_zero",
   "start": 396.675,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Now suppose each air parcel keeps its temperature, with no sunshine or mixing.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 396.675,
     "end": 402.125,
     "dur": 5.45,
     "start_frame": 11900,
     "end_frame": 12064
    },
    {
     "text": "Then the balloon's reading never changes: capital D T by D t is zero, and the pattern slides with the wind.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 402.475,
     "end": 410.45,
     "dur": 7.975,
     "start_frame": 12074,
     "end_frame": 12314
    },
    {
     "text": "Put zero in, then subtract v dot grad T from both sides.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 410.8,
     "end": 415.575,
     "dur": 4.775,
     "start_frame": 12324,
     "end_frame": 12467
    },
    {
     "text": "Partial T by partial t equals minus v dot grad T.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 415.925,
     "end": 420.575,
     "dur": 4.65,
     "start_frame": 12478,
     "end_frame": 12617
    }
   ],
   "end": 421.375,
   "start_frame": 11900,
   "end_frame": 12641
  },
  {
   "id": "s19_pole_cools",
   "start": 421.375,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "So the pole's thermometer falls, point one eight degrees an hour.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 421.375,
     "end": 425.9,
     "dur": 4.525,
     "start_frame": 12641,
     "end_frame": 12777
    },
    {
     "text": "Look upwind, where the wind comes from.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 426.25,
     "end": 429.275,
     "dur": 3.025,
     "start_frame": 12788,
     "end_frame": 12878
    },
    {
     "text": "The air reaching the pole in one hour is there now, point one eight degrees colder; in two hours, point three six.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 429.625,
     "end": 437.325,
     "dur": 7.7,
     "start_frame": 12889,
     "end_frame": 13120
    },
    {
     "text": "So the pole reads thirteen, then twelve point eight two, then twelve point six four.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 437.675,
     "end": 443.325,
     "dur": 5.65,
     "start_frame": 13130,
     "end_frame": 13300
    }
   ],
   "end": 444.125,
   "start_frame": 12641,
   "end_frame": 13324
  },
  {
   "id": "s20_twice_steep",
   "start": 444.125,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Make the map twice as steep.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 444.125,
     "end": 446.475,
     "dur": 2.35,
     "start_frame": 13324,
     "end_frame": 13394
    },
    {
     "text": "The wind's shadow is still five metres per second: it belongs to the wind.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 446.825,
     "end": 452.125,
     "dur": 5.3,
     "start_frame": 13405,
     "end_frame": 13564
    },
    {
     "text": "But v dot grad T doubles, and the pole cools twice as fast.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 452.475,
     "end": 457.125,
     "dur": 4.65,
     "start_frame": 13574,
     "end_frame": 13714
    },
    {
     "text": "The dot product holds the steepness; the shadow alone doesn't.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 457.475,
     "end": 461.825,
     "dur": 4.35,
     "start_frame": 13724,
     "end_frame": 13855
    }
   ],
   "end": 462.625,
   "start_frame": 13324,
   "end_frame": 13879
  },
  {
   "id": "s21_recap",
   "start": 462.625,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "So what does the dot product measure?",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 462.625,
     "end": 465.45,
     "dur": 2.825,
     "start_frame": 13879,
     "end_frame": 13964
    },
    {
     "text": "How much two arrows point the same way, times both their lengths.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 465.8,
     "end": 470.0,
     "dur": 4.2,
     "start_frame": 13974,
     "end_frame": 14100
    },
    {
     "text": "Its sign says same way, across, or opposite.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 470.35,
     "end": 473.95,
     "dur": 3.6,
     "start_frame": 14111,
     "end_frame": 14219
    },
    {
     "text": "With a unit vector, it's a component.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 474.3,
     "end": 477.3,
     "dur": 3.0,
     "start_frame": 14229,
     "end_frame": 14319
    },
    {
     "text": "In physics, it joins a direction with a size: work, and the wind's warming or cooling.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 477.65,
     "end": 484.225,
     "dur": 6.575,
     "start_frame": 14330,
     "end_frame": 14527
    }
   ],
   "end": 485.025,
   "start_frame": 13879,
   "end_frame": 14551
  },
  {
   "id": "s22_end",
   "start": 485.025,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Try it yourself in the vector products lab, and in the notebook.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 485.025,
     "end": 489.35,
     "dur": 4.325,
     "start_frame": 14551,
     "end_frame": 14681
    }
   ],
   "end": 489.65,
   "start_frame": 14551,
   "end_frame": 14690
  }
 ],
